    "body": "I meant to say: whenever the browser chooses to update the rendering of the OffscreenCanvas as per the event loop section. By \"make it explicit\" you mean on the rendering update section?\r\n\r\nI'm not sure what you mean by your question. Could you clarify it?\r\n\r\nThe overall idea is:\r\n\r\n- canvas gets transferred to an offscreenCanvas.\r\n- OffscreenCanvas gets sent to a Worker.\r\n- During the rendering update of the Worker, the current OffscreenCanvas gets redraw (updated) AND the content of the original canvas (the placeholder canvas) gets updated.\r\n\r\nNotice that the rendering update of the main document doesn't play a part here at all.",
    "created_at": "2018-08-09T14:16:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-01-15T07:57:16Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/3872#discussion_r208946389",
